---
flowchart TB
    %% Layout: TB, 7 nodes; checked viewBox 741x796, height/width 1.07; font 16px.
    classDef own fill:#d4edda,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1f2933
    classDef human fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#1f2933

    subgraph action["Part 1　Action | Once tools are connected"]
        direction LR
        A["What may it do?<br/>What actually happened?<br/>What counts as done?"]
        B["Targets and task authorization<br/>Results in external systems<br/>Evidence against requirements"]
        A --> B
    end

    subgraph handoff["Part 2　Handoff | Someone else continues"]
        direction LR
        C["Who takes over?<br/>What is complete?<br/>What remains unknown?"]
        D["Verifiable approval scope<br/>Known and unknown state<br/>A way to resume and recover"]
        C --> D
    end

    subgraph memory["Part 3　Memory | Experience for the next task"]
        direction LR
        E["Does it still apply?<br/>What conditions have changed?<br/>Were corrections retrieved?"]
        F["Sources, versions, conditions<br/>Corrections and deletions take effect<br/>Checks in the new task"]
        E --> F
    end

    action -->|Hand off work| handoff
    handoff -->|Retain experience| memory
    memory -.->|The next task| G["Recheck current conditions<br/>Read evidence and open questions<br/>Decide how much work to delegate"]
    class B,D,F own
    class G human
